<http://www.spektrix.com/yukonartscentre/event/72201AHVJHMKDPLTHSHSHMMBQTMGGKBCN>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Broadway and Beyond";
  schema:description """
	LDAY is delighted to present Broadway and Beyond, featuring Robert Pilon. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Stage, television and recording artist, Robert Pilon performed as Jean Valjean in Les Miserables and the Phantom in The Phantom of the Opera (Toronto and cross-country productions). Robert will be accompanied by some of his favourite Toronto musicians as well as local talent bringing Broadway classics (The Phantom of the Opera, Les Miserables, The Lion King) and popular favourites to the Arts Centre stage. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Brain injuries impact so many Yukoners and we are thankful to Robert for helping us lift up this important cause. We’ll be donning glitz and glam and encourage you to sport your finest Yukon Formal as suits you! <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Join us for a reception (starting at 6:30pm) featuring a theatrical photo booth and celebrating the important work done by LDAY, including supports for people with brain injuries. The curtain goes up at 7:30pm. Can’t wait to share in this with you! <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Thank you to our generous sponsors and supporters! <span><br/></span>Donald K. Johnson C.C.LL.D<span><br/></span>Elizabeth Burridge<span><br/></span>Northern Vision Development<span><br/></span>PJ Productions<span><br/></span>Garfield Mitchell<span><br/></span>The Joseph Lebovic and Wolf Lebovic Foundation<span><br/></span>Photography by Archbould Photography, catering by AliCat Catering<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>* People with sound and light sensitivity might be more comfortable with ear plugs and sunglasses<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>* There are three ticket price options, so you can pay what you decide.
""";
