<http://www.spektrix.com/yukonartscentre/event/73401APJTQRQMNDQCLBJRTVNGHRMDLQCV>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Jazz on the Wing: Electric Bassist Carl Mayotte Quintet";
  schema:description """
	“With a groove that has no limits, the creativity of the compositions will surprise you. ... the young sensation of the Quebec jazz scene brings his musical universe to new boundaries, showing that jazz is more than ever alive.” - Bass Magazine<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Carl Mayotte is one of the leading figures in contemporary jazz fusion in Québec. A bassist, composer, arranger, and educator, he stands out for his dazzling virtuosity, impeccable rhythmic precision, and signature sense of groove.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Winner of the Félix Award for Jazz Album of the Year at ADISQ in 2022 and Radio-Canada Jazz Revelation 2020–2021, his musical approach combines technical mastery with expressiveness, captivating both seasoned jazz fans and newcomers alike. A graduate of McGill University with a master’s degree in jazz performance, he blends discipline with stage energy, creating a powerful musical universe that draws on modern jazz, progressive rock, funk, and Latin influences. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>In March 2026, he released his fifth album, Claude, a tribute to the memory of his father.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Carl Mayotte – electric bass, Gabriel Cyr – guitar, Damien-Jade Cyr – saxophones, Francis Grégoire – piano and keyboards, Stéphane Chamberland – drums  <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>SPECIAL OFFER UNTIL SEPT 27, BUY 5 Jazz on the Wing tickets FOR THE PRICE OF 4.<span><br/></span>Adults: $132, Youth: $60<span><br/></span>Purchase at Yukon Arts Centre Box Office 667-8574 by phone or in-person.   <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Jazz on the Wing cabaret<span><br/></span>Presented by Jazz Yukon<span><br/></span>More info: jazzyukon.ca<span><br/></span>
""";
