<http://www.spektrix.com/yukonartscentre/event/77401ATDSDLQCDJCLVLHGVLTPSDBJPPBK>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Stage Fright 'Round Back: A delightful evening of spooky stories";
  schema:description """
	Join us for the first Stage Fright at 'Round Back! A delightful evening of spooky stories in our outdoor venue. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Local storytellers share their tales of the ghostly and ghastly that they have been workshopping with master storyteller Jaime Mellott over the last month. All storytellers will be sharing their original works, but it will be up to you to decide what's true and terrifying and what's truly terrifying! <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The evening will be punctuated by the lighting of Pivot Theatre Lighting workshop participants who have been working with the storytellers and with lighting Instructor Norah Paton.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Bring your blanket and dress for the weather. We will have hot drinks and the bar will be open throughout the evening. <span><br/></span>Adult themes that may not be suitable for little goblins.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Thank you to our sponsors and funders: Government of Yukon, Lotteries Yukon, City of Whitehorse, Kilrich Building Centres, Whitehorse Motors, What’s Up Yukon, SPK Home Construction Ltd, Yukon Brewing, Jazz Yukon, Co-operators Insurance, Air North and  Crêperie La Petit Maison<span><br/></span>
""";
